Package: webguard-server-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: WebGuard <security@marcel-breuer.dev>
Depends: systemd
Description: Privacy-focused outbound-only WebGuard server telemetry agent
 The WebGuard Server Agent collects bounded local server telemetry and sends it
 to a configured WebGuard Server Health endpoint. It exposes no inbound
 listener and does not execute remote commands.
